WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.725
Investigation Methodology.

00:00:02.675 --> 00:00:16.475
Every node on this board traces to public government records: Hansard transcripts, Lobbying Commissioner Registry, Elections Canada filings, RCMP public reports, court decisions, and Auditor General findings.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:22.625
Entities are clustered by frequency of interaction and weighted by co-occurrence in official records.
